-----------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Discount Sensitivity Analysis
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
Business Question:
Do discounts increase quantity sold?
*/

SELECT
    category_name,
    CASE
        WHEN discount >= 0.20 THEN 'High Discount'
        ELSE 'Low Discount'
    END AS discount_bucket,
    AVG(quantity) AS avg_quantity_sold,
    SUM(net_sales) AS revenue
FROM analytics.fact_sales f
JOIN analytics.dim_products p
ON f.product_key = p.product_key
GROUP BY
    category_name,
    CASE
        WHEN discount >= 0.20 THEN 'High Discount'
        ELSE 'Low Discount'
    END;

/* Insight :

Our data shows that customers are inelastic to discounts, offering big discounts doesn't actually make 
customers buy more bikes at once; they still just buy one.
Instead, these sales are mainly helping us clear inventory and bringing in about 20% of our total revenue.

*/
